From ec25a2fe59854cb5a51ca21a20202e98b4a00d64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Freddie Honohan <honohanf@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:52:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Spend: CHECKMULTISIG counts range-checked as whole
 numbers, key limit INT_MAX as in ts-sdk

A key or signature count wider than an i64 was read as 0. ts-sdk Spend without explicit flags allows up to
INT_MAX keys (this crate stopped at 20); the stack must hold the keys before anything is allocated.

Found by b017-native's interpreter regressions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rkfed16fxRUgKofZPqhvxT
